      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "UPSCALE VIDEO - FAST (per frame, any length, full movies OK)\n\n1. Load Video: pick or upload the clip.\n2. Upscale model (main):\n     2xLiveActionV1_SPAN      live-action film/TV/camcorder (default)\n     2xVHS2HD-RealPLKSR       VHS / analog tape captures\n     RealESRGAN_x2plus        clean digital sources\n     RealESRGAN_x4plus / realesr-general-x4v3   4x for very small sources\n3. Clean-up pass (purple, bypassed): select it and press Ctrl+B to turn it on\n   for blocky, compressed sources (old web video, low-bitrate DVD rips).\n4. Resize: shorter_size is the output height for landscape video\n   (720, 1080, 1440, 2160). Width follows the aspect ratio.\n5. Video Combine: crf (x264) 16-20 is visually lossless; on an NVENC GPU cq is used instead, about crf + 6 (cq 24 ~ crf 18). Lower = bigger file.\n   Audio is carried over from the source.\n\nLong clips are processed in chunks of frames_per_batch (Meta Batch Manager);\none Queue press runs the whole file. Several files: load and queue each one.\n\nInterlaced sources (480i/576i, combing on motion) must be deinterlaced first:\n  ffmpeg -i in.mkv -vf bwdif -c:v libx264 -crf 14 -c:a copy out.mp4\nOutput lands in output/ as upscaled-*-audio.mp4."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
